This license is a **source-available, limited open access license**. It is intended to permit human inspection, academic review, reproducibility testing, and limited non-commercial local experimentation while preserving the Licensor's commercial rights and prohibiting AI/ML training, model development, hosted services, production deployment, and commercial exploitation without a separate written agreement.

This license is **not** an Open Source Initiative approved open source license.

