Subject to full compliance with this license, the Licensor grants You a worldwide, royalty-free, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable, revocable license to:

2.1 read and inspect the Licensed Materials;

2.2 copy the Licensed Materials solely as necessary for permitted Non-Commercial Use;

2.3 run the Software locally for permitted Non-Commercial Use;

2.4 modify the Licensed Materials solely for private, local, Non-Commercial Use;

2.5 publish non-commercial commentary, criticism, academic discussion, benchmark results, or reproducibility notes about the Licensed Materials, provided that You do not disclose protected implementation details beyond what is reasonably necessary for such discussion and You retain attribution to the Licensor;

2.6 submit patches, issues, or pull requests to the Licensor under Section 13.

No other rights are granted.

