## 3. Limited Academic and Public-Interest Access

3.1 Academic/Public Institutions may use the Licensed Materials for research, teaching, public-interest review, safety analysis, and reproducibility testing without charge, provided that all such use remains Non-Commercial and complies with this license.

3.2 Academic/Public Institutions may not use the Licensed Materials for AI/ML Use, Production Use, Hosted Services, commercial partnerships, sponsored commercial research, technology transfer, procurement evaluation, or product development without a separate written license from the Licensor.

3.3 Publication of research findings is allowed, but publication must not include the Licensed Materials in full, disclose non-public implementation details beyond reasonable academic necessity, or enable unauthorized Commercial Use, AI/ML Use, Production Use, or Hosted Services.

